{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026JE6LnwWIXQ1792795341.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中東緊張局勢持續升級，原油期貨價格升超過百分之3。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報103.27美元一桶，升3.8美元，升幅百分之3.8。倫敦期油收市報116.72美元一桶，升3.55美元，升幅百分之3.1，見六個月高位。</p><p></p><p>全個星期計，紐約期油升近百分之2，倫敦期油升百分之6，連升第三個星期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T23:24:31.625217+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T22:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T23:58:24.368766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T23:18:11.966000+00:00","content_hash":"48fb54773c04d2cb1e20d3deed62691a3100b078851c0cc4b0688e625e0e28c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}